      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>A salon set up Place de la Gare, in the Les Palmiers building, on avenue Maréchal Lyautey in Cavalaire-sur-Mer. Coeur de Poils highlights a space designed for animal wellbeing, with a selection of dog products and accessories available on site.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon is closed on weekends (Saturday and Sunday), so it's best to plan your appointment during the week, especially if you're only passing through for a few days. Hours are split in two, with a midday break like many businesses in the area.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: while you're at the salon, take a look at the accessories sold on site — handy if you forgot a leash or harness when you left for your holiday.</div>

